          "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{P}_{\\mathbf{G}}^{\\mathbf{G}}&\\left(\\lambda_{1}\\right)\\quad\\mathbf{P}^{-1}\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{P}=\\left(\\lambda\\right)\\\\\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d u}{d t}&=\\lambda u\\\\ \\frac{d v}{d t}&=\\lambda v\\end{aligned}\\right.&\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}u&=u_{0}e^{\\lambda t}\\\\ v&=v_{0}e^{\\lambda t}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\quad\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{u_{0}}{v_{0}}\\\\\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\\\quad\\alpha<0,\\lambda<0\\\\\\quad\\alpha>0,\\lambda>0",
